<section class="mission" id="how-it-works"><div><p class="eyebrow">A SHARED TABLE</p><h2>Small connections.<br>Meaningful change.</h2><p>A coordinated journey from a donor’s kitchen to a receiver’s community.</p></div><div class="steps"><article><span>01 / GIVE</span><h3>Share what’s available</h3><p>Donors record surplus food, handling details, and collection deadlines.</p></article><article><span>02 / CONNECT</span><h3>Find the right fit</h3><p>Eligible receivers are matched by capacity, availability, and pickup feasibility.</p></article><article><span>03 / COLLECT</span><h3>Make the handoff count</h3><p>Coordinated collection and recorded outcomes make each handoff traceable.</p></article></div></section>
